    "issues": {
        "rf_gateway_unsupported": {
            "title": "{name} identifies as an RF Gateway, not a PoE Shade",
            "description": "Your device identifies as an RF Gateway, not a PoE Shade. The maintainer of hass-powershades (@vemboy200) cannot build or test this integration against RF gateways.\n\nThis can mean some entities may not work as expected, a future change could unknowingly break compatibility, and there's no support for features exclusive to RF gateways. On top of that, there's no documentation for this setup, and dynamic and stale device handling (which doesn't matter for PoE shades) isn't implemented, despite this integration claiming Platinum.\n\nPlease report your experience so this can be tracked and improved."
        }
    },
